## Facebook Crack

Small replica with buttons which are for now not actioned to anything

## Features
Facebook style header
Logo
Navigation bar buttons similar to facebook
Search bar

## TechStack
HTML
CSS
Js

## Approach
- First make the skeleton which is the HTML side
- Make a rough idea of how facebook looks like with the help of HTML
- Then slowly start to style each component one by one with the help of CSS
- Finally make some of the buttons work as well with the help of JS

##Challenges
- Search was dropping below the facebook text so made it to flex
- Avatars was turning to oval so made the image as square then put a circle on top of it
- Dark mode emoji was not switiching because i wrote the if/else condition above the button initialization
- divs were bit confusing but made it work
